    AND (`the record date as changed` GREATER THAN `the original record date`)
    AND (`the payment date as changed` GREATER THAN `the original payment date`)
    AND (`the payment date as changed` AT MOST (`the date` (`period in days` 60) `after` `the record date as changed`))

-- In either case the corporation gives notice of the change to stockholders as promptly as practicable thereafter
